<div class="svc-work-page" id="svcWorkPage">
  <header class="svc-work-top" id="svcWorkTop"></header>
  <nav class="svc-work-stepper" id="svcWorkStepper" aria-label="Etapas do reparo"></nav>
  <main class="svc-work-main" id="svcWorkMain"></main>
  <footer class="svc-work-footer" id="svcWorkFooter"></footer>
</div>

<div class="svc-stage-overlay" id="svcStageModal" hidden aria-hidden="true">
  <form class="svc-stage-card" id="svcStageForm" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="svcStageTitle">
    <header class="svc-stage-head">
      <div>
        <p class="svc-stage-kicker">Fluxo personalizado</p>
        <h3 id="svcStageTitle">Nova etapa</h3>
        <p>Cadastre o que surgiu durante o reparo, sem depender de um modelo pronto.</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcStageCloseBtn" aria-label="Fechar">✕</button>
    </header>
    <div class="svc-stage-body">
      <input type="hidden" id="svcStageKey">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label">Tipo da etapa</label>
        <div class="svc-stage-types" id="svcStageTypes" role="group" aria-label="Tipo da etapa">
          <button type="button" class="svc-stage-type is-active" data-type="service" aria-pressed="true"><span>🔧</span> Serviço</button>
          <button type="button" class="svc-stage-type" data-type="part" aria-pressed="false"><span>📦</span> Peça/material</button>
          <button type="button" class="svc-stage-type" data-type="diagnostic" aria-pressed="false"><span>🔎</span> Diagnóstico</button>
          <button type="button" class="svc-stage-type" data-type="other" aria-pressed="false"><span>📝</span> Outro</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-stage-name-grid">
        <div class="form-group svc-stage-icon-field">
          <label class="form-label" for="svcStageIcon">Ícone</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="svcStageIcon" value="🔧" maxlength="8" aria-label="Ícone da etapa">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label" for="svcStageLabel">Nome da etapa *</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="svcStageLabel" placeholder="Ex.: Troca do conector de carga" maxlength="120" required>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label" for="svcStageNote">Contexto para o cliente</label>
        <textarea class="form-input" id="svcStageNote" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Ex.: Conector oxidado; substituição autorizada pelo cliente."></textarea>
        <span class="svc-stage-help">Você poderá registrar o trabalho técnico e as fotos dentro da etapa.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label" for="svcStagePrice">Valor de referência interno (opcional)</label>
        <div class="svc-stage-money-field">
          <span>R$</span>
          <input class="form-input" id="svcStagePrice" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0,00">
        </div>
        <span class="svc-stage-help">Usado apenas na tela da oficina; não aparece no relatório do cliente.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <footer class="svc-stage-foot">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcStageCancelBtn">Cancelar</button>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="svcStageSaveBtn">Adicionar etapa</button>
    </footer>
  </form>
</div>

<div class="svc-delete-overlay" id="svcDeleteModal" hidden aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="svc-delete-card" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="svcDeleteTitle">
    <div class="svc-delete-icon">🗑️</div>
    <h3 id="svcDeleteTitle">Remover esta etapa?</h3>
    <p><strong id="svcDeleteStageName"></strong> será retirada do fluxo e do relatório. As anotações e fotos vinculadas deixarão de aparecer.</p>
    <div class="svc-delete-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcDeleteCancelBtn">Manter etapa</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm svc-delete-confirm" id="svcDeleteConfirmBtn">Sim, remover</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="svc-share-overlay" id="svcShareModal" hidden>
  <div class="svc-share-card" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="svcShareTitle">
    <header class="svc-share-head">
      <div>
        <h3 id="svcShareTitle">Enviar relatório ao cliente</h3>
        <p>Escolha o que enviar. O WhatsApp usa o número conectado em Configurações (Baileys).</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcShareCloseBtn" aria-label="Fechar">✕</button>
    </header>
    <div class="svc-share-preview" id="svcSharePreview">
      <div class="svc-share-preview-loading">Preparando visualização...</div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-share-options">
      <label class="svc-share-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="svcShareOptWhatsapp" checked> Enviar WhatsApp</label>
      <label class="svc-share-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="svcShareOptLink" checked> Link do relatório</label>
      <label class="svc-share-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="svcShareOptQr" checked> QR Code no envio</label>
      <label class="svc-share-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="svcShareOptPdf"> Anexar PDF (URL)</label>
      <label class="svc-share-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="svcShareOptImage"> Anexar imagem (URL)</label>
      <label class="svc-share-opt"><input type="checkbox" id="svcShareOptDelivered"> Marcar como entregue</label>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-share-link-box" id="svcShareLinkBox" hidden>
      <label class="form-label">Link público</label>
      <div class="svc-share-link-row">
        <input class="form-input" id="svcShareLinkInput" readonly>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcShareCopyLinkBtn">Copiar</button>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-share-qr-wrap" id="svcShareQrWrap" hidden>
        <img id="svcShareQrImg" alt="QR Code do relatório" width="160" height="160">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-share-result" id="svcShareResult" hidden></div>
    <footer class="svc-share-foot">
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcShareDownloadImgBtn">Baixar imagem</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="svcShareDownloadPdfBtn">Gerar PDF</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="svcShareSendBtn">Enviar ao cliente</button>
    </footer>
  </div>
</div>
